          <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #0284c7; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Buffer Preparation Studio &rarr;</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.4;">
            Calculate conjugate salt weights, buffer capacity (&beta;), and Henderson-Hasselbalch recipes.
          </div>
